{"c":"421048","n":"MILEVSKÝ POTOK 1","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"Milevsko","url":"421048-milevsky-potok-1","stav":"2026-10-11","popis":"Přítok Smutné – Lužnice. Od ústí potoka Milevského do Smutné až k pramenům, včetně potoka Držkrajovského (GPS Z: 49°25'59.985\"N, 14°23'58.68\"E, K: 49°27'25.401\"N, 14°24'9.683\"E). Do revíru nepatří rybník\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nMarván, Hrůzův, Korunský a rybník Tovaryš. Zákaz čeřínkování na potoce v úseku mezi mostem v parku Bažantnice a hrází Korunského rybníka. V úseku nad rybníkem Tovaryš až k můstku u ČOV v obci Sepekov je hájený úsek – lov ryb zakázán.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nK revíru patří nádrže:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nSuchanův rybník\tv k. ú. Milevsko\t0,8 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°26'41.469\"N, 14°21'37.23\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nSmolařovský\tMilevsko\t1 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°27'17.8\"N, 14°21'23.705\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nNa nádrži Suchanův rybník platí zákaz lovu ryb z hráze.","delka":19,"rozloha":5,"lat":49.436333,"lon":14.395017,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/milevsko","mo_tel":"+420603835865","mo_mail":"crsmomilevsko@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false